{
  "id": "the-simpsons---5x20---the-boy-who-knew-too-much",
  "title": "The Simpsons - 5x20 - The Boy Who Knew Too Much",
  "sourceFilename": "The Simpsons - 5x20 - The Boy Who Knew Too Much.en.sub",
  "importedAt": "2026-09-13T03:32:08.133Z",
  "lineCount": 293,
  "lines": [
    {
      "index": 0,
      "text": "[ Chorus ] \" The Simpsons \"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 2070,
      "endMs": 4210
    },
    {
      "index": 1,
      "text": "[ Tires Screeching ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 6010,
      "endMs": 6960
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "text": "D'oh! [ Screams ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 8530,
      "endMs": 10290
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Oh! How can they imprison kids in school on a beautiful day like this?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 29100,
      "endMs": 33030
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "text": "They're not imprisoning us, Bart. They're--",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 33380,
      "endMs": 35530
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Prison bus, Otto? The regular school bus broke down.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 39960,
      "endMs": 43030
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "text": "So take a seat before I blow your heads off!.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 43280,
      "endMs": 45140
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "text": "Otto! Oh, sorry.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 45440,
      "endMs": 47010
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "text": "This bus and I have sort of a Shining thing going on.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 47330,
      "endMs": 50260
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "text": "\" [ Blues ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 52660,
      "endMs": 54090
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "text": "Ahhh--",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 58670,
      "endMs": 60110
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "text": "[ Sighs ] This is what being a kid is all about.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 71130,
      "endMs": 75800
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "text": "Hey, Huck, what's L-I-N-C-O-N doing here?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 78620,
      "endMs": 82630
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "text": "I don't know. It's your fantasy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 82900,
      "endMs": 84390
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "text": "Hi, Abe. Hello, Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 84650,
      "endMs": 86220
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "text": "[ All Groaning ] Ow! Ow!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 87970,
      "endMs": 90610
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "text": "Well, children, our new ultra-hard Posturific chairs have arrived.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 93100,
      "endMs": 96860
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "text": "They've been designed by eminent posturologists... to eliminate slouching by the year 3000.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 97150,
      "endMs": 102110
    },
    {
      "index": 18,
      "text": "Mrs. Krabappel-- [ Groans ] I'm having back spasms!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 102410,
      "endMs": 105400
    },
    {
      "index": 19,
      "text": "[ Chuckles ] I know they seem a little uncomfortable right now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 106040,
      "endMs": 108770
    },
    {
      "index": 20,
      "text": "But eventually your bones will change shape.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 109060,
      "endMs": 111320
    },
    {
      "index": 21,
      "text": "[ Slurred ] I've lost all feeling in the left side of my body.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 111570,
      "endMs": 115220
    },
    {
      "index": 22,
      "text": "Yeah. Yeah. Now, unfortunately our school clocks have been running fast all semester... so today we all have to stay two extra hours to make up for the time we lost.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 116020,
      "endMs": 124730
    },
    {
      "index": 23,
      "text": "Ha! [ Groaning ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 125080,
      "endMs": 126820
    },
    {
      "index": 24,
      "text": "[ Sighs ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 129870,
      "endMs": 131010
    },
    {
      "index": 25,
      "text": "[ Chittering ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 135400,
      "endMs": 136590
    },
    {
      "index": 26,
      "text": "[ Engine Rewing ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 138670,
      "endMs": 139880
    },
    {
      "index": 27,
      "text": "And to think I got all this after dropping out of the fourth grade.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 141890,
      "endMs": 145500
    },
    {
      "index": 28,
      "text": "[ Laughs ] [ Tires Screech ] That does it. I'm outta here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 145940,
      "endMs": 149580
    },
    {
      "index": 29,
      "text": "Mrs. Krabappel, I have to go to the dentist.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 151110,
      "endMs": 152660
    },
    {
      "index": 30,
      "text": "I have a caraway seed caught under my bridgework.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 152920,
      "endMs": 155170
    },
    {
      "index": 31,
      "text": "My mom's number's there if you wanna check up on me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 157160,
      "endMs": 159310
    },
    {
      "index": 32,
      "text": "That's okay, Bart. I trust you.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 159600,
      "endMs": 161780
    },
    {
      "index": 33,
      "text": "''Please excuse my handwriting.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 163700,
      "endMs": 165380
    },
    {
      "index": 34,
      "text": "''I busted whichever hand it is I write with.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 165730,
      "endMs": 167620
    },
    {
      "index": 35,
      "text": "Signed, Mrs. Simpson.''",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 167930,
      "endMs": 169460
    },
    {
      "index": 36,
      "text": "You were right to be suspicious, Edna. To the crime lab.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 169800,
      "endMs": 173010
    },
    {
      "index": 37,
      "text": "Hmm. Inconclusive. [ Scoffs ] I wish more students had agreed to these electronic tracking implants.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 175610,
      "endMs": 181700
    },
    {
      "index": 38,
      "text": "We only had one volunteer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 181990,
      "endMs": 183570
    },
    {
      "index": 39,
      "text": "[ Sighs ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 187430,
      "endMs": 188720
    },
    {
      "index": 40,
      "text": "The joys of mortgaging your future.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 189090,
      "endMs": 191890
    },
    {
      "index": 41,
      "text": "[ Splashing ] Huh?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 192770,
      "endMs": 194020
    },
    {
      "index": 42,
      "text": "[ Gasps ] My fantasy's come true!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 196010,
      "endMs": 198770
    },
    {
      "index": 43,
      "text": "Hey, kid. You wanna see a dead body?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 200940,
      "endMs": 204250
    },
    {
      "index": 44,
      "text": "If I were a truant boy out for a good time, I'd be right here-- the Springfield Natural History Museum.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 207410,
      "endMs": 213800
    },
    {
      "index": 45,
      "text": "[ Chuckling ] You're mine, Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 214290,
      "endMs": 217280
    },
    {
      "index": 46,
      "text": "Look, if I was under 17, I'd be in school, right?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 219190,
      "endMs": 221800
    },
    {
      "index": 47,
      "text": "Yeah, I guess you're right. Enjoy Boob-A-Rama, sir.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 221800,
      "endMs": 224940
    },
    {
      "index": 48,
      "text": "Why, there are no children here at the 4-H Club either.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 226750,
      "endMs": 229400
    },
    {
      "index": 49,
      "text": "Am I so out of touch?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 229820,
      "endMs": 231620
    },
    {
      "index": 50,
      "text": "No. It's the children who are wrong.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 232330,
      "endMs": 234530
    },
    {
      "index": 51,
      "text": "Sold to the small man with the runny nose for 2.3 million.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 237330,
      "endMs": 240520
    },
    {
      "index": 52,
      "text": "[ Snickers ] [ Clears Throat ] Our next highest bid, uh...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 240880,
      "endMs": 245180
    },
    {
      "index": 53,
      "text": "I believe was yours, sir, for 2.1 million.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 245550,
      "endMs": 247770
    },
    {
      "index": 54,
      "text": "[ Laughs ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 248180,
      "endMs": 249590
    },
    {
      "index": 55,
      "text": "[ Doors Slams ] Yes. Were there any serious bids for this painting?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 250480,
      "endMs": 253620
    },
    {
      "index": 56,
      "text": "[ All Murmuring ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 254130,
      "endMs": 255620
    },
    {
      "index": 57,
      "text": "[ Gasps ] [ Gasps ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 257950,
      "endMs": 259260
    },
    {
      "index": 58,
      "text": "Can't let Dad see me playing hooky!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 261170,
      "endMs": 262450
    },
    {
      "index": 59,
      "text": "Can't let the boy see me skippin' work.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 262740,
      "endMs": 264520
    },
    {
      "index": 60,
      "text": "Good afternoon. How do you do, sir?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 267140,
      "endMs": 269340
    },
    {
      "index": 61,
      "text": "[ Both Snicker]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 269680,
      "endMs": 271000
    },
    {
      "index": 62,
      "text": "[ Both ] Sucker!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 272250,
      "endMs": 273540
    },
    {
      "index": 63,
      "text": "[ Gasps ] A spoor! Hmm-- His brand of gum, Doublemint.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 275250,
      "endMs": 280320
    },
    {
      "index": 64,
      "text": "Trying to double your fun, eh, Bart?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 280750,
      "endMs": 282740
    },
    {
      "index": 65,
      "text": "Well, I'll double your detention.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 283050,
      "endMs": 284690
    },
    {
      "index": 66,
      "text": "And so we enter endgame.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 285910,
      "endMs": 289020
    },
    {
      "index": 67,
      "text": "Ay, caramba!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 293760,
      "endMs": 295510
    },
    {
      "index": 68,
      "text": "[ Panting ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 296400,
      "endMs": 297470
    },
    {
      "index": 69,
      "text": "[ Evil Laugh ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 308910,
      "endMs": 310240
    },
    {
      "index": 70,
      "text": "Let's see him track me now.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 310600,
      "endMs": 312300
    },
    {
      "index": 71,
      "text": "Oh, my God! He is like some sort of... non-giving up... school guy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 325270,
      "endMs": 333210
    },
    {
      "index": 72,
      "text": "[ Grunting ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 338410,
      "endMs": 339610
    },
    {
      "index": 73,
      "text": "Oh, he's close.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 367520,
      "endMs": 368890
    },
    {
      "index": 74,
      "text": "I can taste his fear.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 369260,
      "endMs": 370990
    },
    {
      "index": 75,
      "text": "What the--",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 373160,
      "endMs": 374480
    },
    {
      "index": 76,
      "text": "[ Laughs ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 377850,
      "endMs": 379490
    },
    {
      "index": 77,
      "text": "Freddy, honey. I think something just dropped into the backseat.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 380010,
      "endMs": 383080
    },
    {
      "index": 78,
      "text": "I'm not paying you to talk.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 383450,
      "endMs": 385110
    },
    {
      "index": 79,
      "text": "Gimme the ball!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 396760,
      "endMs": 397860
    },
    {
      "index": 80,
      "text": "People, the punch has been spiked. [ Laughs ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 399320,
      "endMs": 402920
    },
    {
      "index": 81,
      "text": "[ Laughs ] That's my nephew... displaying the Quimby wit that's won the public's heart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 404580,
      "endMs": 410750
    },
    {
      "index": 82,
      "text": "Happy birthday, Freddy. And may all your disgraces be, uh, private.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 411120,
      "endMs": 415420
    },
    {
      "index": 83,
      "text": "Yes. [ All ] Hear! Hear!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 415770,
      "endMs": 417680
    },
    {
      "index": 84,
      "text": "And who are you, little boy?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 424810,
      "endMs": 426320
    },
    {
      "index": 85,
      "text": "I'm one of your nephews you don't see very often, uh, Bart-Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 426670,
      "endMs": 429730
    },
    {
      "index": 86,
      "text": "Hey, McBain, I'm a big fan, but your last movie really sucked.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 432130,
      "endMs": 435810
    },
    {
      "index": 87,
      "text": "I know. There were script problems from day one.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 436240,
      "endMs": 440080
    },
    {
      "index": 88,
      "text": "Yeah, I'll say. Magic ticket my ass, McBain.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 440470,
      "endMs": 443410
    },
    {
      "index": 89,
      "text": "Maria, my mighty heart is breaking.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 443900,
      "endMs": 447020
    },
    {
      "index": 90,
      "text": "I'll be in the Humvee.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 447470,
      "endMs": 449250
    },
    {
      "index": 91,
      "text": "[ Chattering ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 450900,
      "endMs": 451870
    },
    {
      "index": 92,
      "text": "Hey, what the hell is this?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 452170,
      "endMs": 453730
    },
    {
      "index": 93,
      "text": "It is a bowl of''shao-dair,'' sir.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 453990,
      "endMs": 455300
    },
    {
      "index": 94,
      "text": "Wait a minute. Come here. What did you call it?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 455300,
      "endMs": 457440
    },
    {
      "index": 95,
      "text": "Say it loud enough so everyone can hear. Come on. Say it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 457440,
      "endMs": 460810
    },
    {
      "index": 96,
      "text": "[ Clears Throat ] ''Shao-dair.''",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 461950,
      "endMs": 463750
    },
    {
      "index": 97,
      "text": "''Shao-dair''? ''Shao-dair''?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 466710,
      "endMs": 469340
    },
    {
      "index": 98,
      "text": "It's ''chowdah.'' Say it right!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 469670,
      "endMs": 471470
    },
    {
      "index": 99,
      "text": "''Shah-der.'' [ Laughs ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 473320,
      "endMs": 475300
    },
    {
      "index": 100,
      "text": "Come back here! I'm not through demeaning you!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 478240,
      "endMs": 481050
    },
    {
      "index": 101,
      "text": "Wow! This is the biggest Rice Krispy square I've ever seen.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 484510,
      "endMs": 487860
    },
    {
      "index": 102,
      "text": "Boy, the rich sure know how to live.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 491290,
      "endMs": 493700
    },
    {
      "index": 103,
      "text": "Say it, Frenchy. Say ''chowdah';! Never!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 494090,
      "endMs": 496400
    },
    {
      "index": 104,
      "text": "[ Freddy ] Okay,you asked for it. I'm gonna enjoy this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 496740,
      "endMs": 500000
    },
    {
      "index": 105,
      "text": "[ Pots Banging ] [ Glass Shattering ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 500440,
      "endMs": 502880
    },
    {
      "index": 106,
      "text": "[ Snapping ] [ Waiter ] Ow, ooh. Ow, ooh. Ow, ooh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 504680,
      "endMs": 506290
    },
    {
      "index": 107,
      "text": "Whoa!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 507090,
      "endMs": 508120
    },
    {
      "index": 108,
      "text": "[ Gasps ] Oy! That's gotta hurt!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 509930,
      "endMs": 513540
    },
    {
      "index": 109,
      "text": "Oh, my God!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 515310,
      "endMs": 516500
    },
    {
      "index": 110,
      "text": "Someone's taken a bite out of the big Rice Krispy square!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 517160,
      "endMs": 519660
    },
    {
      "index": 111,
      "text": "Oh, yeah, and the waiter's been brutally beaten. [ Laughs ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 521190,
      "endMs": 523510
    },
    {
      "index": 112,
      "text": "It says Freddy Quimby beat a waiter half to death.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 525300,
      "endMs": 528880
    },
    {
      "index": 113,
      "text": "Those Quimby children are so wild and rich.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 530260,
      "endMs": 532540
    },
    {
      "index": 114,
      "text": "I hope he finally gets what's coming to him.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 532820,
      "endMs": 534750
    },
    {
      "index": 115,
      "text": "But Freddy Quimby's innocent! How do you know? There weren't any witnesses.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 535020,
      "endMs": 538760
    },
    {
      "index": 116,
      "text": "[ Chuckles ] Oh, yeah. Right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 539090,
      "endMs": 541330
    },
    {
      "index": 117,
      "text": "You'd think someone would've seen something at a crowded party like that.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 541670,
      "endMs": 544680
    },
    {
      "index": 118,
      "text": "Well, they didn't, okay? They didn't!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 545010,
      "endMs": 546680
    },
    {
      "index": 119,
      "text": "It says so right here in black-and-white, ''no witnesses.''",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 546970,
      "endMs": 549120
    },
    {
      "index": 120,
      "text": "Case closed. Now, let's all read the funnies.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 549390,
      "endMs": 552000
    },
    {
      "index": 121,
      "text": "Oh, look, Charlie Brown said, ''Good grief.''",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 552380,
      "endMs": 554380
    },
    {
      "index": 122,
      "text": "[ Chuckles ] I didn't see that comin'.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 554670,
      "endMs": 556630
    },
    {
      "index": 123,
      "text": "Lisa, I gotta tell somebody.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 559460,
      "endMs": 561570
    },
    {
      "index": 124,
      "text": "I was at the Quimby compound yesterday when that frog waiter got whacked.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 561940,
      "endMs": 565520
    },
    {
      "index": 125,
      "text": "I know that Freddy Quimby is innocent.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 565800,
      "endMs": 567910
    },
    {
      "index": 126,
      "text": "You're a witness? Bart, you have to tell the police.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 568190,
      "endMs": 570890
    },
    {
      "index": 127,
      "text": "[ Sighs ] I can't. Why?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 571300,
      "endMs": 573800
    },
    {
      "index": 128,
      "text": "[ Brakes Squeal ] Bart Simpson, I know you cut school yesterday.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 574800,
      "endMs": 577430
    },
    {
      "index": 129,
      "text": "And as soon as I can prove it, I'm shipping you off... to the Christian Military Reform School.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 577820,
      "endMs": 582820
    },
    {
      "index": 130,
      "text": "What he said.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 583400,
      "endMs": 584820
    },
    {
      "index": 131,
      "text": "Oh, I see. If you testify, Skinner will know you skipped school.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 585180,
      "endMs": 588990
    },
    {
      "index": 132,
      "text": "Well, if Freddy Quimby didn't do it...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 589490,
      "endMs": 591600
    },
    {
      "index": 133,
      "text": "I'm sure he'll be found innocent by a fair and impartial jury.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 591930,
      "endMs": 595810
    },
    {
      "index": 134,
      "text": "Oh,jury duty!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 596150,
      "endMs": 597830
    },
    {
      "index": 135,
      "text": "I'll see that Quimby kid hang for this!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 598140,
      "endMs": 600300
    },
    {
      "index": 136,
      "text": "Let's go over to the county courthouse live to Kent Brockman.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 601380,
      "endMs": 604700
    },
    {
      "index": 137,
      "text": "...ockman,just outside the county courtroom where an argument about chowder... has spilled over into the biggest trial in Springfield history.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 605010,
      "endMs": 611620
    },
    {
      "index": 138,
      "text": "Behind these doors, a federal judge will ladle out steaming bowls... of rich, creamy justice in a case the media have dubbed...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 611940,
      "endMs": 619030
    },
    {
      "index": 139,
      "text": "''Beat-up Waiter.'' [ Scoffs ] This reporter suggested ''Waitergate,'' but was shouted down at the press club.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 619390,
      "endMs": 625880
    },
    {
      "index": 140,
      "text": "Now, it's illegal to televise court proceedings in this state...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 625880,
      "endMs": 628300
    },
    {
      "index": 141,
      "text": "[ Whispering ] so we'll have to be quiet.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 628780,
      "endMs": 630330
    },
    {
      "index": 142,
      "text": "[ Thinking ] I know you can read my thoughts, Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 635890,
      "endMs": 638000
    },
    {
      "index": 143,
      "text": "Just a little reminder-- if I find out you cut class... your ass is mine.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 638310,
      "endMs": 643930
    },
    {
      "index": 144,
      "text": "Yes, you heard me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 644520,
      "endMs": 646140
    },
    {
      "index": 145,
      "text": "I think words I would never say.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 646600,
      "endMs": 649400
    },
    {
      "index": 146,
      "text": "I know you can read my thoughts, boy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 650210,
      "endMs": 653420
    },
    {
      "index": 147,
      "text": "\" Meow meow meow meow Meow meow meow meow \"",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 653750,
      "endMs": 656520
    },
    {
      "index": 148,
      "text": "I intend to prove that Freddy Quimby is totally innocent.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 660050,
      "endMs": 664400
    },
    {
      "index": 149,
      "text": "First of all, his accuser is a very shady character.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 664750,
      "endMs": 668440
    },
    {
      "index": 150,
      "text": "That waiter, Mr. LaCoste, not only wasn't born in Springfield... he wasn't even born in this country!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 668850,
      "endMs": 676150
    },
    {
      "index": 151,
      "text": "[ Gasping, Murmuring ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 676540,
      "endMs": 678220
    },
    {
      "index": 152,
      "text": "It's an exclusive.! From now on, you tell me everything.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 679420,
      "endMs": 682740
    },
    {
      "index": 153,
      "text": "Uh, Freddy Quimby was with me the entire... night in question.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 683390,
      "endMs": 687370
    },
    {
      "index": 154,
      "text": "We were collecting canned goods for the starving people in... uh, you know, one of them loser countries.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 687700,
      "endMs": 693480
    },
    {
      "index": 155,
      "text": "Well, that clears Quimby. He's clearly innocent.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 694260,
      "endMs": 696040
    },
    {
      "index": 156,
      "text": "Oh, good. My laundry is done.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 696670,
      "endMs": 699020
    },
    {
      "index": 157,
      "text": "You see, Lisa? They don't need my testimony.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 699410,
      "endMs": 701470
    },
    {
      "index": 158,
      "text": "Only because Mayor Quimby is buying his nephew's freedom.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 701780,
      "endMs": 704390
    },
    {
      "index": 159,
      "text": "[ Sighs ] The system works. Just ask Claus von Bulow.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 704890,
      "endMs": 708810
    },
    {
      "index": 160,
      "text": "Ladies and gentlemen, I'm going to prove to you not only that Freddy Quimby is guilty... but that he is also innocent of not being guilty.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 709130,
      "endMs": 716280
    },
    {
      "index": 161,
      "text": "I refer you to my expert witness, Dr. Hibbert.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 716730,
      "endMs": 719680
    },
    {
      "index": 162,
      "text": "Well, only one in two million people has... what we call the ''evil gene.''",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 720040,
      "endMs": 724790
    },
    {
      "index": 163,
      "text": "Hitler had it. Walt Disney had it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 725100,
      "endMs": 727530
    },
    {
      "index": 164,
      "text": "And Freddy Quimby has it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 727940,
      "endMs": 730100
    },
    {
      "index": 165,
      "text": "Thank you, Dr. Hibbert. I rest my case.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 731090,
      "endMs": 734180
    },
    {
      "index": 166,
      "text": "You rest your case?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 734600,
      "endMs": 736390
    },
    {
      "index": 167,
      "text": "What? Oh, no. I thought that was just a figure of speech.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 736730,
      "endMs": 738900
    },
    {
      "index": 168,
      "text": "Case closed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 739300,
      "endMs": 740900
    },
    {
      "index": 169,
      "text": "Excuse me, Your Honor. Yes, I'd like to bring something to the court's attention.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 741810,
      "endMs": 746510
    },
    {
      "index": 170,
      "text": "[ Snoring ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 746910,
      "endMs": 748680
    },
    {
      "index": 171,
      "text": "Huh? What? Give those glasses to the bailiff.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 751820,
      "endMs": 754840
    },
    {
      "index": 172,
      "text": "All right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 755210,
      "endMs": 756370
    },
    {
      "index": 173,
      "text": "And those. Oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 758480,
      "endMs": 760150
    },
    {
      "index": 174,
      "text": "Your Honor, even though I've proven my client's innocence...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 761040,
      "endMs": 763680
    },
    {
      "index": 175,
      "text": "I'd still like to call Freddy Quimby to the stand... so that we can all bask in his gentle decency.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 764020,
      "endMs": 770500
    },
    {
      "index": 176,
      "text": "He's wealthy, therefore, inherently good. [ Woman ] Yes, innocent.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 770920,
      "endMs": 774130
    },
    {
      "index": 177,
      "text": "Mr. Quimby, did you assault Mr. LaCoste?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 774670,
      "endMs": 777920
    },
    {
      "index": 178,
      "text": "Of course not. I love each and every living thing on God's green earth.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 778290,
      "endMs": 782130
    },
    {
      "index": 179,
      "text": "Well, therefore, you certainly would never lose your temper... over something as trivial as the pronunciation of''chowder.''",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 782480,
      "endMs": 788750
    },
    {
      "index": 180,
      "text": "That's ''chowdah!'' ''Chowdah!'' I'll kill you!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 789070,
      "endMs": 791800
    },
    {
      "index": 181,
      "text": "I'll kill all of you! Especially those of you in the jury!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 792120,
      "endMs": 794810
    },
    {
      "index": 182,
      "text": "[ Gasps, Murmuring ] He's clearly guilty.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 795170,
      "endMs": 797070
    },
    {
      "index": 183,
      "text": "Wow, that didn't go well. The defense rests.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 797380,
      "endMs": 799750
    },
    {
      "index": 184,
      "text": "Will the jury retire and come to its decision?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 800070,
      "endMs": 802560
    },
    {
      "index": 185,
      "text": "[ Chuckles ] This won't take long.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 803080,
      "endMs": 804630
    },
    {
      "index": 186,
      "text": "He's clearly guilty. We'll probably be home by dinnertime.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 804990,
      "endMs": 807910
    },
    {
      "index": 187,
      "text": "Good. Tonight, the dog from Frasier is gonna ride the dolphin on SeaQuest.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 808220,
      "endMs": 812350
    },
    {
      "index": 188,
      "text": "Well, Bart, because of you... a horrible yet innocent person is going to jail.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 813380,
      "endMs": 818010
    },
    {
      "index": 189,
      "text": "Hmm. Maybe I should come forward.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 818400,
      "endMs": 821450
    },
    {
      "index": 190,
      "text": "Oh, I can't wait till the sentencing part. That's where I really shine.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 821940,
      "endMs": 825270
    },
    {
      "index": 191,
      "text": "Bart Simpson, for the heinous crime of hooky...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 827220,
      "endMs": 829970
    },
    {
      "index": 192,
      "text": "I sentence you to a lifetime of hard labor in the cafeteria.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 830320,
      "endMs": 834370
    },
    {
      "index": 193,
      "text": "[ Raspy Voice ] More creamed corn,JimboJr.?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 836450,
      "endMs": 838600
    },
    {
      "index": 194,
      "text": "This creamed corn tastes like creamed crap.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 839020,
      "endMs": 841870
    },
    {
      "index": 195,
      "text": "Watch the potty mouth, honey.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 842190,
      "endMs": 844030
    },
    {
      "index": 196,
      "text": "[ Sighs ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 845990,
      "endMs": 847120
    },
    {
      "index": 197,
      "text": "Your sister says you have something to tell me.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 848330,
      "endMs": 850820
    },
    {
      "index": 198,
      "text": "What? Uh-- Um, yeah. Oh, I just-- I just wanted to say how great it is... to finally see some chicks on the bench.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 851160,
      "endMs": 859250
    },
    {
      "index": 199,
      "text": "Mm. Keep up the good work, toots.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 859600,
      "endMs": 861410
    },
    {
      "index": 200,
      "text": "[ Laughs ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 861750,
      "endMs": 862940
    },
    {
      "index": 201,
      "text": "[ Groans ] [ Chuckles ] Chicks on the bench.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 865150,
      "endMs": 868290
    },
    {
      "index": 202,
      "text": "Why bother votin'? He's guilty.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 875350,
      "endMs": 877170
    },
    {
      "index": 203,
      "text": "Well, we might as well make it official.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 877500,
      "endMs": 879300
    },
    {
      "index": 204,
      "text": "What does ''sequestered'' mean? If the jury is deadlocked, they are put in a hotel together... so they can't communicate with the outside world.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 879610,
      "endMs": 885070
    },
    {
      "index": 205,
      "text": "What does ''deadlocked'' mean? It's when the jury can't agree on a verdict.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 885400,
      "endMs": 888360
    },
    {
      "index": 206,
      "text": "Uh-huh. And ''if'? A conjunction meaning...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 888730,
      "endMs": 891260
    },
    {
      "index": 207,
      "text": "''in the event that'' or ''on condition that.''",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 891560,
      "endMs": 893660
    },
    {
      "index": 208,
      "text": "So if we don't all vote the same way... we'll be deadlocked... and have to be sequestered... in the Springfield Palace Hotel.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 894000,
      "endMs": 905490
    },
    {
      "index": 209,
      "text": "That's not gonna happen, Homer.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 905840,
      "endMs": 907480
    },
    {
      "index": 210,
      "text": "Let's vote. My liver is failing.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 907730,
      "endMs": 909520
    },
    {
      "index": 211,
      "text": "Where we'll get: a free room, free food, free swimming pool... free HBO-- Ooh! Free Willy.!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 909840,
      "endMs": 915220
    },
    {
      "index": 212,
      "text": "Justice is not a frivolous thing, Simpson.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 915500,
      "endMs": 917200
    },
    {
      "index": 213,
      "text": "It has little, if anything, to do with a disobedient whale.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 917200,
      "endMs": 919540
    },
    {
      "index": 214,
      "text": "Now let's vote. Uh, how are the rest of you voting?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 919820,
      "endMs": 922360
    },
    {
      "index": 215,
      "text": "Guilty. Okay, fine.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 922620,
      "endMs": 925050
    },
    {
      "index": 216,
      "text": "How many S's in ''innocent''? [ Groaning ] I'm only doing what I think is right.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 925380,
      "endMs": 930080
    },
    {
      "index": 217,
      "text": "I believe Freddy Quimby should walk out of here a free hotel.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 930390,
      "endMs": 934350
    },
    {
      "index": 218,
      "text": "Oh, I miss you too, Marge.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 938850,
      "endMs": 940500
    },
    {
      "index": 219,
      "text": "But the law needs me. I'll be home as soon as I can.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 941050,
      "endMs": 944370
    },
    {
      "index": 220,
      "text": "Room service, send up two more pot roasts... and three more pillows with mints on 'em.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 945500,
      "endMs": 950190
    },
    {
      "index": 221,
      "text": "\" [ Itchy And Scratchy Theme ] So, Bart... have your insides been gnawed away by guilt yet?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 950190,
      "endMs": 954910
    },
    {
      "index": 222,
      "text": "Sell it to Hallmark, Sis.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 955220,
      "endMs": 956940
    },
    {
      "index": 223,
      "text": "You're looking at cucumber boy. As in, ''cool as a'' [ Announcer] Next on McGarnigal-- McGarnigal is framed for a crime he didn't commit.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 957200,
      "endMs": 964970
    },
    {
      "index": 224,
      "text": "And only one witness can clear his name... a little sissy boy who's too scared to come forward.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 965210,
      "endMs": 971090
    },
    {
      "index": 225,
      "text": "You gotta tell him what you saw, Billy.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 971380,
      "endMs": 973190
    },
    {
      "index": 226,
      "text": "But I'm so scared, McGarnigal.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 973510,
      "endMs": 976200
    },
    {
      "index": 227,
      "text": "You gotta do this one for me, Billy. McGarnigal.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 976490,
      "endMs": 979720
    },
    {
      "index": 228,
      "text": "Okay. For you, McGarnigal.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 980130,
      "endMs": 983710
    },
    {
      "index": 229,
      "text": "Well, McGarnigal, Billy is dead!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 984260,
      "endMs": 987260
    },
    {
      "index": 230,
      "text": "They slit his throat from ear to ear.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 987880,
      "endMs": 990040
    },
    {
      "index": 231,
      "text": "Hey, I'm trying to eat lunch here.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 990320,
      "endMs": 993640
    },
    {
      "index": 232,
      "text": "Jump, Free Willy!Jump.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 996270,
      "endMs": 998720
    },
    {
      "index": 233,
      "text": "Jump with all your might.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 999330,
      "endMs": 1001840
    },
    {
      "index": 234,
      "text": "Ahh-- [ Screams ] [ Splats ] [ Woman ] Oh, no. Willy didn't make it!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1007140,
      "endMs": 1011930
    },
    {
      "index": 235,
      "text": "And he crushed our boy!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1012220,
      "endMs": 1013960
    },
    {
      "index": 236,
      "text": "[ Man ] Ugh! What a mess. Oh!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1014300,
      "endMs": 1016360
    },
    {
      "index": 237,
      "text": "I don't like this new director's cut.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1016810,
      "endMs": 1019070
    },
    {
      "index": 238,
      "text": "\" [ Humming ] Mom, what if there's a really bad, crummy guy... who's going to jail, but I know he's innocent.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1019600,
      "endMs": 1025410
    },
    {
      "index": 239,
      "text": "Well, Bart, your Uncle Arthur used to have a saying...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1025690,
      "endMs": 1028550
    },
    {
      "index": 240,
      "text": "''Shoot 'em all, and let God sort 'em out.''",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1028840,
      "endMs": 1030990
    },
    {
      "index": 241,
      "text": "Unfortunately, one day he put his theory into practice.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1031340,
      "endMs": 1033730
    },
    {
      "index": 242,
      "text": "It took 75 federal marshals to bring him down.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1034020,
      "endMs": 1036490
    },
    {
      "index": 243,
      "text": "Now, let's never speak of him again.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1036740,
      "endMs": 1038780
    },
    {
      "index": 244,
      "text": "\" [ Humming ] Mom? Mom!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1039490,
      "endMs": 1043720
    },
    {
      "index": 245,
      "text": "Mom! Hmm?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1044950,
      "endMs": 1046310
    },
    {
      "index": 246,
      "text": "What if I can get this guy off the hook?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1046620,
      "endMs": 1048990
    },
    {
      "index": 247,
      "text": "I mean, sh-should I do it?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1049600,
      "endMs": 1051250
    },
    {
      "index": 248,
      "text": "Honey, you should listen to your heart and not the voices in your head... like a certain uncle did one gray December morn.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1051550,
      "endMs": 1059370
    },
    {
      "index": 249,
      "text": "\" [ Humming ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1060070,
      "endMs": 1061070
    },
    {
      "index": 250,
      "text": "[ Sighs ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1061670,
      "endMs": 1062770
    },
    {
      "index": 251,
      "text": "Even though reopening a trial at this point... is illegal and grossly unconstitutional...",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1063720,
      "endMs": 1068870
    },
    {
      "index": 252,
      "text": "I just can't say no to kids.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1069180,
      "endMs": 1071770
    },
    {
      "index": 253,
      "text": "So, young man... if Freddy Quimby didn't inflict these injuries on Mr. LaCoste... just who did?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1073890,
      "endMs": 1081500
    },
    {
      "index": 254,
      "text": "Well, I was hiding in the kitchen when it all happened.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1082690,
      "endMs": 1085750
    },
    {
      "index": 255,
      "text": "Say it, Frenchy.! Say ''chowdah';!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1086190,
      "endMs": 1088100
    },
    {
      "index": 256,
      "text": "Never! Okay, you asked for it.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1088420,
      "endMs": 1090810
    },
    {
      "index": 257,
      "text": "I'm gonna enjoy this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1091260,
      "endMs": 1092790
    },
    {
      "index": 258,
      "text": "[ Grunting ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1093260,
      "endMs": 1094370
    },
    {
      "index": 259,
      "text": "[ Snapping ] Ow, ooh. Ow, ooh. Ow, ooh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1099030,
      "endMs": 1100760
    },
    {
      "index": 260,
      "text": "And that's what really happened. This is an outrage!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1120100,
      "endMs": 1122830
    },
    {
      "index": 261,
      "text": "I am not a clumsy Clouseau-esque waiter!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1123110,
      "endMs": 1126100
    },
    {
      "index": 262,
      "text": "I will-- Whoa! Whoo! Whoo!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1126540,
      "endMs": 1129210
    },
    {
      "index": 263,
      "text": "[ Screaming ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1130220,
      "endMs": 1131690
    },
    {
      "index": 264,
      "text": "Ooh! Ow! Ow! Ow!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1132840,
      "endMs": 1134200
    },
    {
      "index": 265,
      "text": "At least there were no big ones.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1134830,
      "endMs": 1136470
    },
    {
      "index": 266,
      "text": "[ Loud Clamp ] Ay.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1136840,
      "endMs": 1138240
    },
    {
      "index": 267,
      "text": "How could you have seen all this, Bart? Weren't you supposed to be in school?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1138520,
      "endMs": 1141480
    },
    {
      "index": 268,
      "text": "[ Inhales ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1142500,
      "endMs": 1143720
    },
    {
      "index": 269,
      "text": "I... sorta skipped school.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1144060,
      "endMs": 1146760
    },
    {
      "index": 270,
      "text": "I knew it! I knew you'd slip up sooner or later, Simpson!",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1147020,
      "endMs": 1149680
    },
    {
      "index": 271,
      "text": "What slipup? What are you talking about?",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1150030,
      "endMs": 1151700
    },
    {
      "index": 272,
      "text": "He confessed it. Quiet. I need this.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1151940,
      "endMs": 1154020
    },
    {
      "index": 273,
      "text": "This court finds Freddy Quimby innocent of all charges.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1154420,
      "endMs": 1157660
    },
    {
      "index": 274,
      "text": "Case dismissed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1158140,
      "endMs": 1159890
    },
    {
      "index": 275,
      "text": "[ Cheering ]",
      "kind": "sdh",
      "startMs": 1160300,
      "endMs": 1161630
    },
    {
      "index": 276,
      "text": "Bart, I'm impressed with what you did in there.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1165200,
      "endMs": 1167190
    },
    {
      "index": 277,
      "text": "You testified for the Quimby boy, even though it was putting your own head in a noose.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1167490,
      "endMs": 1170810
    },
    {
      "index": 278,
      "text": "On the other hand, you skipped school.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1171150,
      "endMs": 1173610
    },
    {
      "index": 279,
      "text": "I guess the two things cancel each other out, huh.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1173930,
      "endMs": 1176580
    },
    {
      "index": 280,
      "text": "[ Sighs ] I'm a small man in some ways, Bart.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1177010,
      "endMs": 1180510
    },
    {
      "index": 281,
      "text": "A small, petty man.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1180880,
      "endMs": 1182940
    },
    {
      "index": 282,
      "text": "Three months detention. [ Groans ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1183550,
      "endMs": 1185540
    },
    {
      "index": 283,
      "text": "[ Homer ] Well, Marge, it was horrible.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1187780,
      "endMs": 1190360
    },
    {
      "index": 284,
      "text": "Everyone was against me in that jury room.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1190700,
      "endMs": 1192910
    },
    {
      "index": 285,
      "text": "But I stood by the courage of my convictions, and I prevailed.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1193200,
      "endMs": 1196250
    },
    {
      "index": 286,
      "text": "And that's why we had Chinese food for lunch.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1196570,
      "endMs": 1200380
    },
    {
      "index": 287,
      "text": "Good for you, Homie.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1200700,
      "endMs": 1202300
    },
    {
      "index": 288,
      "text": "You know, a lot of things happened around here while you were gone.",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1202600,
      "endMs": 1205420
    },
    {
      "index": 289,
      "text": "Great, Marge. I want to hear all about it. [ Chuckles ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1205710,
      "endMs": 1209250
    },
    {
      "index": 290,
      "text": "[ Marge ] Give me those.! [ Glasses Snap, Homer Groans ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1209910,
      "endMs": 1211890
    },
    {
      "index": 291,
      "text": "And those. [ Snap, Groan ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1212330,
      "endMs": 1213880
    },
    {
      "index": 292,
      "text": "And those. [ Snap, Groan ]",
      "kind": "dialogue",
      "startMs": 1214220,
      "endMs": 1216160
    }
  ],
  "meta": {
    "show": "The Simpsons",
    "season": 5,
    "episode": 20
  }
}
